# Copy to `.env.local`. `.env*` is gitignored.
#
# Where the Vite dev server sends `/api/*`. Sign-in lives on the Spring backend, so this is required
# rather than optional: without it `/api/*` falls through to the Cloudflare D1 route handlers, which
# still expect the ChatGPT proxy's identity headers and cannot serve this login. See vite.config.ts
# and backend/README.md section 7.
HANDOVER_API_TARGET=http://localhost:8080

# Only needed when the Spring backend sets `handover.auth.gateway-secret`. The dev proxy is the
# gateway, so it attaches this header; without it every call arrives unauthenticated. Must match
# `HANDOVER_GATEWAY_SECRET` in `backend/.env` and in `.dev.vars`.
HANDOVER_GATEWAY_SECRET=
HANDOVER_GATEWAY_SECRET_HEADER=x-handover-gateway-secret
